<% seo_page(
  title: "About Arqvexa | Interior Design & IT Development Studio",
  description: "Learn about Arqvexa — an umbrella studio combining interior design in Delhi NCR and IT development across India, founded by Asif and Shalu.",
  canonical: site_url(about_path)
) %>

<% breadcrumbs(
  { label: "Home", url: site_url },
  { label: "About", url: site_url(about_path) }
) %>

<%= render "shared/navigation" %>

<main id="main-content" class="page-main">
  <%= render_breadcrumbs %>

  <section class="page-hero page-hero-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> About</div>
      <h1>Interior Design &amp; IT Development. <em>One Studio.</em></h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Arqvexa is built on a simple idea: spaces and software both deserve the same level of craft — neither is an afterthought.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="about-badge reveal">
        <div class="badge-ring">AV</div>
        <span>Founded by<br><strong>Asif &amp; Shalu</strong></span>
      </div>
      <div class="content-prose reveal delay-1">
        <h2>Our story</h2>
        <p>Arqvexa started when two founders saw the same pattern: businesses and homeowners were juggling separate vendors for their physical spaces and digital presence — often with mismatched branding and duplicated effort.</p>
        <p>Instead of treating interior design or IT as a side service, Arqvexa gives <strong>both divisions equal focus</strong> under one umbrella brand. Clients can hire one division or both, with one team that communicates clearly.</p>

        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Interior Design</strong> — residential and commercial interiors, modular kitchens, 3D visualization and execution support across Delhi NCR.</li>
          <li><strong>IT Development</strong> — websites, e-commerce, mobile apps, CRM, AI automation and custom software for clients across India and remotely.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Why both under one roof?</h2>
        <p>A new office, showroom or clinic often needs interiors and a website at the same time. Arqvexa keeps layout, brand colours, photography and digital touchpoints aligned — without forcing you to repeat the same brief to unrelated agencies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container founders founders-page reveal">
      <article class="founder-card">
        <h2>Asif</h2>
        <p class="founder-role">Founder · Technology &amp; Business</p>
        <p>Asif leads Arqvexa's IT division — websites, web applications, mobile apps, CRM systems, AI chatbots and business software. He focuses on practical delivery: clear scope, maintainable code, SEO-ready marketing sites and tools teams actually use.</p>
        <%= link_to "Explore IT Development", it_development_path, class: "text-link" %>
      </article>
      <article class="founder-card">
        <h2>Shalu</h2>
        <p class="founder-role">Co-Founder · Interior Design</p>
        <p>Shalu leads interior design at Arqvexa — residential and commercial spaces, modular kitchens, wardrobes, 3D visualization and execution coordination across Delhi, Gurgaon and Noida.</p>
        <%= link_to "Explore Interior Design", interior_design_path, class: "text-link" %>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-prose reveal">
      <h2>Service areas</h2>
      <p><strong>Interior Design:</strong> Delhi NCR — on-site visits, measurements and execution coordination in Delhi, Noida and Gurgaon.</p>
      <p><strong>IT Development:</strong> India and remote — discovery calls, demos and delivery online for clients anywhere in the country.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Email: <%= contact_email_link %><br>
        Phone / WhatsApp: <%= link_to contact_phone_display, "https://wa.me/919917639330", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener noreferrer" %>
      </p>
      <%= link_to "Get a quote", contact_page_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%= render "shared/footer" %>
